					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Nice subject here, a beneficial thing that is so as long as you leave it to its job, though admitedly more tags would serve better for this article. Maybe this could solve the road hole problems where I live. Finally, I can ride a Harley without risk of landing into one hole and flying to my death!</p> <blockquote> <p>Effect seems limited to paved United States roadways</p> </blockquote> <p>NO NO NO, YOU RUINED IT. THIS IS WHY WE CAN'T HAVE NICE ROADWAYS HERE IN MEXICO.</p> 
				 	]]>
